    <briefdescription>
<para>Internal renderer responsible for building and updating QSGNode marker geometry for a <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Renders per-point markers as two triangles per point. The vertex buffer depends only on the point count, so data updates of the same size only upload the data texture. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
